  "lyrics": "[Intro – Spoken, funky beat]\r\n\r\nHey! Look around!\r\nWhat's everybody doing now?\r\n\r\n[Verse 1 – Rhythmic, playful]\r\n\r\nI'm dancing, dancing!\r\nShe's singing, singing!\r\nHe's reading, reading!\r\nWe're jumping, jumping!\r\n\r\nLook at me, look at you!\r\nWhat are we doing?\r\nWe're dancing too!\r\n\r\n[Pre-Chorus – Call and response]\r\n\r\nWhat am I doing?\r\nI'm dancing!\r\n\r\nWhat is she doing?\r\nShe's singing!\r\n\r\nWhat is he doing?\r\nHe's reading!\r\n\r\nEverybody, move with me!\r\n\r\n[Chorus – Catchy, repetitive]\r\n\r\nWhat are you doing?\r\nI'm dancing, dancing!\r\n\r\nWhat is she doing?\r\nShe's singing, singing!\r\n\r\nWhat are they doing?\r\nThey're jumping, jumping!\r\n\r\nRight here, right now,\r\nEverybody's moving!\r\n\r\n[Verse 2 – Playful questions]\r\n\r\nAre you dancing?\r\n(Yes, I am!)\r\n\r\nAre you reading?\r\n(No, I'm not!)\r\n\r\nIs he writing?\r\n(Yes, he is!)\r\n\r\nIs she singing?\r\n(Yes, she is!)\r\n\r\nAre they jumping?\r\n(Yes, they are!)\r\n\r\nLook around!\r\nWhat are you doing now?\r\n\r\n[Chorus – Repeat the same melody]\r\n\r\nWhat are you doing?\r\nI'm dancing, dancing!\r\n\r\nWhat is she doing?\r\nShe's singing, singing!\r\n\r\nWhat are they doing?\r\nThey're jumping, jumping!\r\n\r\nRight here, right now,\r\nEverybody's moving!\r\n\r\n[Bridge – Rhythmic breakdown, one action at a time]\r\n\r\nI am dancing!\r\nShe is singing!\r\nHe is reading!\r\nYou are writing!\r\nThey are jumping!\r\n\r\nDance! Dance!\r\nSing! Sing!\r\nRead! Read!\r\nWrite! Write!\r\nJump! Jump!\r\n\r\n[Final Chorus – Full energy]\r\n\r\nWhat are you doing?\r\nI'm dancing, dancing!\r\n\r\nWhat is she doing?\r\nShe's singing, singing!\r\n\r\nWhat are they doing?\r\nThey're jumping, jumping!\r\n\r\nRight here, right now,\r\nEverybody's moving!\r\n\r\n[Outro – Short funky ending]\r\n\r\nWhat are you doing?\r\nI'm learning English!\r\n\r\nRight here, right now!"
